<title>SLOVAKIA: World Bank calls for fast sale of Slovak bank IRB.</title>
<headline>World Bank calls for fast sale of Slovak bank IRB.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The World Bank (WB) has called for Slovakia to privatise the third largest commercial bank IRB a.s., &quot;as soon as possible&quot;, the daily Pravda reported on Friday.</p>
<p>But the paper, quoting a World Bank report on Slovakia, said officials should take a cautious approach in the sell-off of other banks slated for privatisation,</p>
<p>&quot;The World bank recommends completion of the privatisation of IRB as soon as possible&quot;, the paper quoted the report as saying.</p>
</text>
